# Copy to .env.local and paste your Vercel AI Gateway key.
# NOTE: no VITE_ prefix. This key is read ONLY by the Vite dev server's
# proxy (see vite.config.ts) and is never shipped to the browser bundle.
#
# Create / manage keys at https://vercel.com/dashboard/ai-gateway/api-keys
# Set a spending limit on the key - that's your main protection against a leak.
AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=
